" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.4\">Jr 50.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.16\">2Sm 12.16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:22\" href=\"/Ezra.8.22\">Ed 8.22</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.19\">Is 45.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.1\">Is 65.1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.4\">2Cr 15.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.15\">2Cr 15.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:10\" href=\"/Hosea.7.10\">Os 7.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.13\">Jr 29.13</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:1\" href=\"/Malachi.3.1\">Ml 3.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:17\" href=\"/Psalms.40.17\">Sl 40.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 70:5\" href=\"/Psalms.70.5\">Sl 70.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:7\" href=\"/Psalms.69.7\">Sl 69.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:3\" href=\"/Daniel.9.3\">Dn 9.3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דבר י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:12\" href=\"/Amos.8.12\">Am 8.12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:17\" href=\"/Psalms.83.17\">Sl 83.17</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  seguido de infinitivo com <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>, de recorrer a adivinhos, mas sem objeto <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.31\">Lv 19.31</a> (H). <strong>4.</strong>  <em>desejar, demandar:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  acusativo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:11\" href=\"/Exodus.10.11\">Êx 10.11</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.3\">1Cr 21.3</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  acusativo da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.26\">Ez 7.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:20\" href=\"/Daniel.1.20\">Dn 1.20</a>. <strong>5.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>requerer, exigir</em>, acusativo da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיַּד</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.12\">Is 1.12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.12\">Ne 5.12</a>, acusativo da coisa, versículo <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.18\">Ne 5.18</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>exigir compensação equivalente</em> ou <em>pena</em> por algo, acusativo da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיַּד</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:39\" href=\"/Genesis.31.39\">Gn 31.39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:9\" href=\"/Genesis.43.9\">Gn 43.9</a> (JE) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.16\">1Sm 20.16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.11\">2Sm 4.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.18\">Ez 3.18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.20\">Ez 3.20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.8\">Ez 33.8</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דרשׁ</span>; sem objeto expresso <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:23\" href=\"/Joshua.22.23\">Js 22.23</a> (P). <strong>6.</strong>  (tardio) <em>pedir, solicitar</em>, acusativo da coisa <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:15\" href=\"/Esther.2.15\">Et 2.15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> da coisa <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.4\">Ne 2.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:7\" href=\"/Esther.7.7\">Et 7.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:23\" href=\"/Ezra.8.23\">Ed 8.23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלִּפְנֵי</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:8\" href=\"/Esther.4.8\">Et 4.8</a>; acusativo da coisa, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:8\" href=\"/Daniel.1.8\">Dn 1.8</a> (oração objetiva com <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:21\" href=\"/Psalms.104.21\">Sl 104.21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> da pessoa <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.4\">2Cr 20.4</a>.<br><strong>Pual</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבֻקַּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.20\">Jr 50.20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:23\" href=\"/Esther.2.23\">Et 2.23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֲּבֻקְשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.21\">Ez 26.21</a> <em>ser buscado</em>.",
