      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָד</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:18\" href=\"/Exodus.9.18\">Êx 9.18</a></sup> <strong>granizo (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَرَدٌ</span>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܰܪܕܳܐ</span>; também sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">ברדם</span>, <em>frio</em> DHM<sup>ZMG 1875, 607</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:18\" href=\"/Exodus.9.18\">Êx 9.18</a> + 28 vezes;—<em>granizo</em>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">המטיר י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:18\" href=\"/Exodus.9.18\">Êx 9.18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:23\" href=\"/Exodus.9.23\">Êx 9.23</a>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:23\" href=\"/Exodus.9.23\">Êx 9.23</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:19\" href=\"/Exodus.9.19\">Êx 9.19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:22\" href=\"/Exodus.9.22\">Êx 9.22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:24\" href=\"/Exodus.9.24\">Êx 9.24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:25\" href=\"/Exodus.9.25\">Êx 9.25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:25\" href=\"/Exodus.9.25\">Êx 9.25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:26\" href=\"/Exodus.9.26\">Êx 9.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:5\" href=\"/Exodus.10.5\">Êx 10.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:12\" href=\"/Exodus.10.12\">Êx 10.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:15\" href=\"/Exodus.10.15\">Êx 10.15</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹלֹת</span> <em>trovão</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:23\" href=\"/Exodus.9.23\">Êx 9.23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:28\" href=\"/Exodus.9.28\">Êx 9.28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:29\" href=\"/Exodus.9.29\">Êx 9.29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:33\" href=\"/Exodus.9.33\">Êx 9.33</a>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹלֹת</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:34\" href=\"/Exodus.9.34\">Êx 9.34</a>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁ</span> relâmpago <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:24\" href=\"/Exodus.9.24\">Êx 9.24</a>; todas JE, praga egípcia; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:47\" href=\"/Psalms.78.47\">Sl 78.47</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:48\" href=\"/Psalms.78.48\">Sl 78.48</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:32\" href=\"/Psalms.105.32\">Sl 105.32</a>; outra grande tempestade de granizo <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">Js 10.11</a> (E), onde <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי הַבּ׳</span>; além disso, em teofania <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:13\" href=\"/Psalms.18.13\">Sl 18.13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גחלי־אשׁ</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.13\">2Sm 22.13</a> omitido por erro; suprima-se, contudo, em <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:14\" href=\"/Psalms.18.14\">Sl 18.14</a> cf. De Che etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוצרות ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:22\" href=\"/Job.38.22\">Jó 38.22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁ וב׳ שׁלג וקיטור</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:8\" href=\"/Psalms.148.8\">Sl 148.8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ירקון וב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:17\" href=\"/Haggai.2.17\">Ag 2.17</a>; em símile <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.2\">Is 28.2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">זרם ב׳ שׁער</span>; figuradamente <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">Is 28.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.30\">Is 30.30</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אבן ב׳)</span>—figura do juízo de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>.",
