      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָה</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: comer (</strong>assírio <em>barû</em> e derivados Zim<sup>BP 31</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.17\">2Sm 12.17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָה</span>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.6\">2Sm 13.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.10\">2Sm 13.10</a> <em>comer pão</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרוּ־לָכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.8\">1Sm 17.8</a> erro de copista por <span dir=\"rtl\">בחדו לכם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.25\">1Rs 18.25</a> Dr<sup>Sm 107</sup>).<br><strong>Piel</strong>  infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.10\">Lm 4.10</a> <em>para devorar</em>.<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּבְרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.5\">2Sm 13.5</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַבְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:35\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.35\">2Sm 3.35</a> <em>fazer comer pão</em>.",
