      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחַ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino. Barra, tranca (</strong>cf. assírio <em>burûḫu, haste de lança, lança</em>, COT<sup>Gloss</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.5\">Dt 3.5</a> + 11 vezes (estado construto <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:5\" href=\"/Amos.1.5\">Am 1.5</a> etc.); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:11\" href=\"/Exodus.35.11\">Êx 35.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:33\" href=\"/Exodus.39.33\">Êx 39.33</a> Ketiv (Qere de ambas <span dir=\"rtl\">־חָיו</span>, desnecessário); plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:26\" href=\"/Exodus.26.26\">Êx 26.26</a> + 8 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.6\">2Cr 14.6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:31\" href=\"/Exodus.36.31\">Êx 36.31</a> + 3 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:13\" href=\"/Nahum.3.13\">Na 3.13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:18\" href=\"/Exodus.40.18\">Êx 40.18</a> + 7 vezes (+ Qere <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:11\" href=\"/Exodus.35.11\">Êx 35.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:33\" href=\"/Exodus.39.33\">Êx 39.33</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.30\">Jr 51.30</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.9\">Lm 2.9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִחֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:7\" href=\"/Jonah.2.7\">Jn 2.7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֶ֑הָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15.5</a>, mas cf. abaixo;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a</strong>  . <em>barra</em>, de madeira, unindo as tábuas do tabernáculo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:26\" href=\"/Exodus.26.26\">Êx 26.26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:27\" href=\"/Exodus.26.27\">Êx 26.27</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:28\" href=\"/Exodus.26.28\">Êx 26.28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:29\" href=\"/Exodus.26.29\">Êx 26.29</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:11\" href=\"/Exodus.35.11\">Êx 35.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:31\" href=\"/Exodus.36.31\">Êx 36.31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:32\" href=\"/Exodus.36.32\">Êx 36.32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:33\" href=\"/Exodus.36.33\">Êx 36.33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:34\" href=\"/Exodus.36.34\">Êx 36.34</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:18\" href=\"/Exodus.40.18\">Êx 40.18</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:36\" href=\"/Numbers.3.36\">Nm 3.36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:31\" href=\"/Numbers.4.31\">Nm 4.31</a> (todas P). <strong>b.</strong>  <em>tranca(s)</em> dos portões da cidade <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.5\">Dt 3.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">Jz 16.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.7\">1Sm 23.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2Cr 8.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.6\">2Cr 14.6</a>; <em>idem</em> dos portões de Jerusalém <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.9\">Lm 2.9</a>; também (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מנעולים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.3\">Ne 3.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.6\">Ne 3.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.13\">Ne 3.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.14\">Ne 3.14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.15\">Ne 3.15</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:13\" href=\"/Psalms.147.13\">Sl 147.13</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:5\" href=\"/Amos.1.5\">Am 1.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:13\" href=\"/Nahum.3.13\">Na 3.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.31\">Jr 49.31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.11\">Ez 38.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.30\">Jr 51.30</a>; trancas dos portões da cidade, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ נחשׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.13\">1Rs 4.13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ ברזל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.2\">Is 45.2</a> (de Babilônia, quebradas diante de Ciro); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֶ֑הָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15.5</a> leia-se provavelmente, com 𝔗 Di e outros, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּר׳</span> veja-se <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּרִיחַ\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּרִיחַ\" dir=\"rtl\">בָּרִיחַ</a>; contudo, cf. a nota crítica de Che.<br><strong>2.</strong>  figuradamente <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ בַּרְזֶל</span> de angústia etc. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:16\" href=\"/Psalms.107.16\">Sl 107.16</a>; de fortaleza, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ אַרְמוֹן</span> em símile <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pv 18.19</a>; figuradamente <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> da terra (representada como casa da qual Jonas está excluído) <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:7\" href=\"/Jonah.2.7\">Jn 2.7</a>. (Uso mais antigo: singular da tranca de porta ou portão, isto é, a grande barra transversal ao portão; assim <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.5\">Dt 3.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">Jz 16.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:5\" href=\"/Amos.1.5\">Am 1.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.7\">1Sm 23.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.13\">1Rs 4.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.31\">Jr 49.31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pv 18.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:10\" href=\"/Job.38.10\">Jó 38.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2Cr 8.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.11\">Ez 38.11</a> Mais tarde, plural <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.2\">Is 45.2</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.9\">Lm 2.9</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.6\">2Cr 14.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.3\">Ne 3.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.6\">Ne 3.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.13\">Ne 3.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.14\">Ne 3.14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.15\">Ne 3.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:13\" href=\"/Psalms.147.13\">Sl 147.13</a>, mas também <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:13\" href=\"/Nahum.3.13\">Na 3.13</a>.)",
